{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters you've grown to know are back and now with more punch than ever.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relationships move forward. Some turn intimate, others grow tense. New bonds form, old ones shift, and rivalries begin to take shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parts of their lives that once stayed hidden now come to the surface. The main character starts to face the trauma that's followed him for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every moment has weight, whether it's a glance, a conversation, or something more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Season brings us one step closer to healing. To love. To something that might finally feel like we've arrived somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899570/extras/266ce10eb6b09b9ef36865f92864eb31.avif?t=1771531765\" width=1058 height=1606 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be played as a standalone (Not recommended) or you can continue your save from &quot;Summer's Gone - Season 1&quot;.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game makes use of over 200+ variables from Season 1 that will shape your relationship and the world you live in.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4K! All images, animations, and cinematics will be in 4K. They will look great on every monitor.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extremely detailed and immersive environments.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 15 deep, and intertwined stories that grow with you over the Season.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid, often minutelong cinematics and animations.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge array of optional kinks.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revamped UI/UX for a smooth experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High quality, hand picked audio.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899570/extras/115d2aad728862b3923c6706735b9c14.avif?t=1771531765\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899570/extras_big/115d2aad728862b3923c6706735b9c14.avif?t=1771531765 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899570?t=1771531765","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899570?t=1771531765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899570/6bcbe8e357e97ede22142cb489cae16744702fd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771531765","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899570/6bcbe8e357e97ede22142cb489cae16744702fd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771531765","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game graphically depicts sexual acts in a pornographic way and features strong language, dark humor/morbid humor, violence,